# QA (M1 Stage 1): D-032/D-035 and game-design.md promise that "any held jump
# off the rampart or the car reaches the Wurstkranz" ("jumping straight off
# the car towards the pole lets held jumps reach the Wurstkranz"). Ride the
# Festungsbahn up (salzburg_festungsbahn's route), stand on the car at the
# top station (x 3946, feet y 152), then hold RIGHT + JUMP: she touches the
# pole at frame 1739 with her feet only 74 px above its base -> 800 (4-6
# tiles), not 5000. Running (RB, RBJ held) from the same spot touches at
# 118 px -> 2000; a walking held jump off the rampart only reaches the
# Wurstkranz when pressed within ~16 px of the rampart's right edge.
# Correct: the held jump off the car scores the Wurstkranz (5000); the
# replay ends during the slide, before the time-bonus tally adds anything.
level  = salzburg
source = handwritten
expect = event=LevelComplete deaths=0 state=stage_clear
expect = score>=13500
